OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with further showers, locally
OL,7,Fheavy in the west at times, these
OL,8,Fcontinue through the evening into
OL,9,FSaturday. Remaining windy through the
OL,10,Fnight, with strong gusts around the
OL,11,Fcoasts. Cooler than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FRemaining partly cloudy with
OL,14,Fshowers, heavy at times. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong winds, gusty around the coasts
OL,16,Fand hills. Showers and winds ease by
OL,17,Fthe evening. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
