OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FGenerally fine and dry on Sunday. Rain
OL,7,Fand low cloud into Monday, heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Drier Monday afternoon with
OL,9,Ffurther rain Tuesday morning. Turning
OL,10,Fmostly dry with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
